Z||000000||bHooper||06-07-2000||09:27 AM||||Hey everyone!  Still enjoying my GT. even though there are still a lot of bugs to work out.<P>Todays problem:  the clutch pedal makes a popping or cracking sound when fully depressed!  It also has a tiny bit of play (side to side) in it.  Could this be the "banjo bushing", or the master cylinder?<P>Also, just curious, should the clutch and brake pedal be at the same hight (when at rest)?<P>Thanks,<BR>hoop||||reg||1
