Z||000006||2birds||06-09-2000||11:00 AM||||Mine has a small amount of free play before I push it, due to slop in the linkage, but I think that's normal.  I'd say check all your bolts for tightness, at the firewall and he pedal pivot point, and if it's causing a problem, get a new master cylinder.  Otherwise, drive it and enjoy it.  ||||reg||1
