Z||000008||batboy||06-09-2000||03:42 PM||||There is a good chance it's that banjo bushing, they do take a lot of wear. Or it could be a broken spring in the pedal assembly. The clutch pedal on my 85 GT is just slightly higher than the brake pedal.||||reg||1
